{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_store/push.py","reason":"Add the s3-remote preflight call at the top of push_tickets_branch (line ~168) so an s3:// remote without a valid helper fails closed before pushing."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/init.py","reason":"Call the s3 helper preflight during store init/mount so misconfiguration is caught at setup time."},{"path":"src/rebar/_store/gitutil.py","reason":"Add a small resolve_remote_url(base_path, remote) wrapper over git remote get-url, reusing run_git, to detect the s3:// scheme."},{"path":"tests/integration/test_s3_preflight.py","reason":"New CLI subprocess tests: missing/too-old helper on an s3:// remote fails closed; non-s3 remote is a no-op."}]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"FILE_IMPACT","timestamp":1786149444513197001,"uuid":"7b88520a-9e32-4821-a9d3-38dae1dda310"}